      "text": {
        "arText": "سَيَصْلَىٰ نَارًا ذَاتَ لَهَبٍ",
        "enText": "He will [enter to] burn in a Fire of [blazing] flame",
        "enTextTransliteration": "Sa yas laa naran zaata lahab",
        "bnText": "সত্বরই সে প্রবেশ করবে লেলিহান অগ্নিতে",
        "bntextLatin": "Satbara'i se prabesa karabe lelihana agnite"
      },
